!/任务列表.md
!/框架设计.md
!/项目评估.md
!/.zcode/

# Approved per-task implementation reports live at the repository root
# (implementation/DSK-<id>.md). Minimal exception only; logs and archives
# inside stay excluded by the rules above.
!/implementation/

# dsk.v1 shared pipeline contracts (DSK-003): DOM/Electron-free DTO and schema
